# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting an internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Lineage: local-only test documents. These hold real personal data and must never be committed.
/test/
desktop.ini

# Generated by scripts/build-wasm.mjs
**/wasm-pkg/
node_modules/

# Office add-in: build output, development storage and the local app registration.
apps/office-addin/dist/
apps/office-addin/.dev-storage/
apps/office-addin/.env.local

# My documents: build output, the local app registration and Playwright's results.
apps/family-app/dist/
apps/family-app/.env.local
apps/family-app/test-results/
apps/family-app/playwright-report/
apps/family-app/e2e/.accounts/


#Build instructions: build output, the local app registration and Playwright's results.
docs/PROMPTS.md
docs/BLUEPRINTS.md
